# #187 turnaround specials: Shadow Hunter a, facing right with b behind it,
# jumps, flicks back and presses Special in the air, and fires backward into b.
# Before #187 the stick-held press started nothing in the air (Serpent Ward is ground-only).
#! chat -dev quick hero shadow hunter
# b dashes left past a and stops behind it.
440 b stick -1 0
510 b stick 0 0
# a jumps; in the air flicks back, releases, then presses Special (turned neutral).
550 a tap B 3
562 a stick -1 0
564 a stick 0 0
566 a tap X 2
# a jumps again; Special with the stick still held back (side press, turned).
730 a tap B 3
742 a stick -1 0
743 a tap X 2
746 a stick 0 0
# Save both turnarounds for native checksum parity.
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
